1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,009
12 carruur ah, hal daraasad.

2
00:00:02,109 --> 00:00:07,843
Malaayiin waalid ayay cabsi gelisay. Dhakhtar Ingiriis ah ayaa sheegay in tallaalka MMR uu keeno otisam.

3
00:00:07,943 --> 00:00:12,992
Daraasaddiisa waxaa laga helay been. Waa la buriyay, shatigiisii dhakhtarnimona waa laga qaaday.

4
00:00:13,092 --> 00:00:20,150
Denmark, daraasad aad u weyn oo carruur ah: kuwa la tallaalay iyo kuwa aan la tallaalin, khatarta otisamku waa isku mid. Xiriir ma jiro.

5
00:00:20,250 --> 00:00:27,788
Laakiin cabsidu way faaftay. Minnesota, tallaalka carruurta Soomaalida aad buu hoos ugu dhacay. Kadib, jadeeco ayaa ku faaftay bulshada.

6
00:00:27,888 --> 00:00:34,881
Otisamku waa xaqiiqo, carruurtuna taageero ayay mudan yihiin. Laakiin tallaalku sabab ma aha. Dhammaan waxay ka bilaabatay…
